# 12. R8 — Recent Trades: strict semantics

Canonical meaning:

| UI | Source | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| **Recent trades** | LIVE | real post-launch executed trades permitted by product rules |
| **Platform bootstrap history** | PBD | historical price/aggregate context, never disguised customer activity |

Never show:

```text
Alice bought 12
Bob sold 8
0x... tx hash
```

for PBD data.

If the product needs a row-based historical component, use:

```text
Bootstrap observation
Platform bootstrap data
Illustrative history
```

and no fake identity/counterparty/wallet/transaction hash.

### UX when there are no live trades

Do not show an empty white box.

Use a useful compact state:

```text
Recent trades
No live trades yet
Historical price context is available above.
```

This is better UX than fabricating activity.

**R8 done when:** live trades are unmistakably live and PBD is unmistakably historical context.

