# 18. Test matrix

## Generator

- same property + version → identical result;
- different property → different trajectory;
- correct number of observations;
- chronological order;
- no future observation;
- positive prices;
- bounded weekly change;
- deterministic final observation;
- version changes are isolated.

## Database

- migration applies cleanly;
- unique constraint prevents duplicate PBD observations;
- second seed is idempotent;
- PBD cleanup only touches its own version;
- live rows survive PBD seed;
- 24 property IDs remain intact.

## Service/API

- bootstrap endpoint returns `provenance=bootstrap`;
- live trades exclude bootstrap;
- mixed chart preserves per-point provenance;
- no private user data in public endpoints;
- range/limit are bounded;
- unknown property returns the repository's standard not-found response;
- public endpoint remains read-only;
- no PBD record is passed to matching/settlement.

## Existing marketplace

- buy still behaves exactly as before;
- sell still behaves exactly as before;
- live order book still uses live orders;
- settlement tests remain green;
- NFT hook/worker tests remain green;
- payout code remains unchanged unless explicitly authorized.

## UI

- resale detail shows 1Y PBD chart;
- PBD badge appears on first render;
- chart does not overflow 480px;
- live-empty state is truthful;
- real trade appears only in Recent trades;
- PBD never looks executable;
- loading/error states work;
- non-resale property detail does not regress.

