# 19. Verification protocol

At each gate:

```text
implement one step
→ run targeted tests
→ verify done-when
→ only then continue
```

Final verification:

```text
npm run check
all relevant unit/integration tests
npm run db:seed:dryrun -w @digihouse/api   (where applicable)
db:seed twice
db:seed:bootstrap-history twice
browser/design review
```

If Postgres/Docker is unavailable, do not fake a green runtime result. Run the dry-run/unit/static checks that are possible and mark DB runtime verification BLOCKED exactly as the program requires.

If a verification fails 3 times:

```text
git checkout -- <files>
mark step BLOCKED
append reason to progress log
continue only with an independent unblocked step
```

